    "body": "Hey thanks for reporting this!\n\nHere is a smaller sample to reproduce which isolates the internal pyscf `kernel_fixed_space` function.\n\n```\nfrom pyscf import fci\n\nmyci = fci.selected_ci.SelectedCI()\nmyci = fci.addons.fix_spin_(myci, ss=0.)\nnum_up = num_dn = 1\nci_strs = ((1, 2), (1, 2))\ne_sci, sci_vec = fci.selected_ci.kernel_fixed_space(\n    myci,\n    hcore,\n    eri,\n    hcore.shape[0],\n    (num_up, num_dn),\n    ci_strs=ci_strs,\n    )\nprint(e_sci)\n```\n\nI don't understand why this isn't producing the value you expect right now, but working off this snippet and trying to understand why pyscf is diverging from your exact calculation might be simpler. This snippet is giving me the `-2.31` value you mentioned",
