    "body": "I translated `hcore` and `eri` to MO basis and got expected value (-1.85727503020238). We should probably be more specific in the documentation that the integrals are expected in this format. Let me know if this works for you and we'll close this out,  @JoelHBierman \n\n```\n# Transform hcore from AO to MO basis\nhcore_mo = mf_h2.mo_coeff.T @ mf_h2.get_hcore() @ mf_h2.mo_coeff\n\n# Transform ERI from AO to MO basis\neri_mo = ao2mo.kernel(mf_h2.mol, mf_h2.mo_coeff)\n```",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
